error[L0517]: a returned closure cannot use `start`, which `counter!` changes
 --> check/changed_by_closure_through_alias.knv:3:18
  |
3 |     (fn () (set! start (+ start 1)) start))
  |                  ^^^^^ the closure uses `start` here
  |
  = note: `start` borrows the caller's value as `mut`, and the closure would keep that borrow for as long as it lives
  = help: copy it first with `(local value start)` and use `value` in the closure
